.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Private planning corpus ----------------------------------------------
# The rebuild plan, the architecture notes, the ADRs and the S0 spike report.
# This repository is public; that material is not, pending the M3 reassessment
# in ADR-0001. It lives here on purpose so the working directory is complete —
# it is simply never committed. Nothing under version control may link to it.
/planning/

# --- Scratch --------------------------------------------------------------
tmp/
scratch/
